WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:03.420
[gentle music]

2
00:00:03.460 --> 00:00:07.340
The Open Compute Project is leading
the way in chiplet collaboration,

3
00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:10.960
creating an open marketplace
where vendors, designers,

4
00:00:10.980 --> 00:00:13.460
and manufacturers can cooperate and share.

5
00:00:14.140 --> 00:00:19.420
OCP's marketplace has a dedicated area for
chiplets open to all solution providers.

6
00:00:19.940 --> 00:00:24.200
Today, it covers products
and technologies for assembly and test,

7
00:00:24.620 --> 00:00:28.740
specifications, CDXML, cost modeling,

8
00:00:29.060 --> 00:00:33.640
design services, EDA,
manufacturing and packaging,

9
00:00:33.940 --> 00:00:37.900
power components, and chiplets
and IP blocks themselves.

10
00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:42.500
Through an open marketplace, companies
can source pre-validated chiplets,

11
00:00:42.840 --> 00:00:44.340
reducing design complexity.

12
00:00:44.760 --> 00:00:48.780
And by helping to standardize
interfaces and improve interoperability,

13
00:00:49.180 --> 00:00:53.080
the OCP open chiplet economy
lowers development barriers,

14
00:00:53.360 --> 00:00:58.300
reduces costs, and accelerates time
to market for new chiplet-based products.

15
00:00:59.480 --> 00:01:02.170
The OCP Experience Centers showcase

16
00:01:02.180 --> 00:01:05.260
real-world applications
of OCP contributions.

17
00:01:05.640 --> 00:01:10.860
The primary focus of any OCP Experience
Center is to accelerate open innovation

18
00:01:11.180 --> 00:01:15.320
and facilitate the widespread
adoption of OCP recognized equipment.

19
00:01:16.580 --> 00:01:21.120
These centers are a cornerstone in OCP
strategy to penetrate emerging markets,

20
00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:27.080
and they complement the OCP Ready product
recognition and OCP Safe programs.

21
00:01:27.880 --> 00:01:31.610
The target audience for these
centers includes adopters and channel

22
00:01:31.620 --> 00:01:35.140
partners seeking firsthand
experience with OCP hardware.

23
00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:40.120
OCP Experience Centers can provide
in-person or virtual access

24
00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:44.810
designed to provide proof points
around OCP solutions, gaining

25
00:01:44.820 --> 00:01:48.900
a deeper understanding of the benefits
offered by OCP recognized equipment.

26
00:01:49.700 --> 00:01:53.350
When it comes to chiplets,
Lawrence Berkeley National Lab

27
00:01:53.360 --> 00:01:57.720
hosts the OCP Experience Center
dedicated to the open chiplet economy.

28
00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:01.890
It features technology
demonstrations showcasing products

29
00:02:01.900 --> 00:02:05.350
and prototypes from different sectors
of the emerging chiplet market,

30
00:02:06.240 --> 00:02:09.819
impacting the development
of specialized ASICs for HPC.

31
00:02:10.419 --> 00:02:14.220
These demonstrations will include
chiplets, chiplet-based products,

32
00:02:14.640 --> 00:02:17.680
IP, workflow
and manufacturing innovations,

33
00:02:18.080 --> 00:02:21.940
as well as tools that help designers
integrate chiplets into ASICs.

34
00:02:22.660 --> 00:02:27.690
The Berkeley Lab is also hosting periodic
workshops to showcase these demonstrations

35
00:02:27.700 --> 00:02:31.880
and bring together industry leaders to
discuss the future of chiplet technology.

36
00:02:32.520 --> 00:02:37.720
OCP is providing the tools and resources
needed to enable the future of chiplets,

37
00:02:38.080 --> 00:02:41.780
but real transformation happens when
individuals like you get involved.

38
00:02:42.500 --> 00:02:45.690
Let's see how you can contribute
to shaping the future of chiplets.

39
00:02:45.700 --> 00:02:51.100
[gentle music]

